{"componentChunkName":"component---src-templates-post-jsx","path":"/Acceptance Test/","result":{"data":{"site":{"siteMetadata":{"title":"Wonyu"}},"markdownRemark":{"id":"f7d5b0c1-7380-5c33-b2ff-f35c6411f797","excerpt":"✅ 사용자 스토리(시나리오)에 맞춰 수행하는 테스트 ✅ 개발자와 이해관계자들 간의 토의를 통해 만들어진 시나리오에 기반해 테스트 ✅ 실제 HTTP 요청을 보내고 응답을 확인하는 최상위 레벨의 테스트   📌 특징 사용자 관점에서 동작 검증 단순한 코드 실행이 아니라, 실제 사용자의 시나리오를 검증함. 예: \"사용자가 회원 가입을 하면, 로그인할 수 있어야 …","html":"<p><strong>✅ 사용자 스토리(시나리오)에 맞춰 수행하는 테스트</strong><br>\n<strong>✅ 개발자와 이해관계자들 간의 토의를 통해 만들어진 시나리오에 기반해 테스트</strong><br>\n<strong>✅ 실제 HTTP 요청을 보내고 응답을 확인하는 최상위 레벨의 테스트</strong>  </p>\n<h2 id=\"-특징\" style=\"position:relative;\"><a href=\"#-%ED%8A%B9%EC%A7%95\" aria-label=\" 특징 permalink\" class=\"heading-anchor before\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"15\" height=\"15\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M6.188 8.719c.439-.439.926-.801 1.444-1.087 2.887-1.591 6.589-.745 8.445 2.069l-2.246 2.245c-.644-1.469-2.243-2.305-3.834-1.949-.599.134-1.168.433-1.633.898l-4.304 4.306c-1.307 1.307-1.307 3.433 0 4.74 1.307 1.307 3.433 1.307 4.74 0l1.327-1.327c1.207.479 2.501.67 3.779.575l-2.929 2.929c-2.511 2.511-6.582 2.511-9.093 0s-2.511-6.582 0-9.093l4.304-4.306zm6.836-6.836l-2.929 2.929c1.277-.096 2.572.096 3.779.574l1.326-1.326c1.307-1.307 3.433-1.307 4.74 0 1.307 1.307 1.307 3.433 0 4.74l-4.305 4.305c-1.311 1.311-3.44 1.3-4.74 0-.303-.303-.564-.68-.727-1.051l-2.246 2.245c.236.358.481.667.796.982.812.812 1.846 1.417 3.036 1.704 1.542.371 3.194.166 4.613-.617.518-.286 1.005-.648 1.444-1.087l4.304-4.305c2.512-2.511 2.512-6.582.001-9.093-2.511-2.51-6.581-2.51-9.092 0z\"/></svg></a><strong>📌 특징</strong></h2>\n<h3 id=\"사용자-관점에서-동작-검증\" style=\"position:relative;\"><a href=\"#%EC%82%AC%EC%9A%A9%EC%9E%90-%EA%B4%80%EC%A0%90%EC%97%90%EC%84%9C-%EB%8F%99%EC%9E%91-%EA%B2%80%EC%A6%9D\" aria-label=\"사용자 관점에서 동작 검증 permalink\" class=\"heading-anchor before\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"15\" height=\"15\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M6.188 8.719c.439-.439.926-.801 1.444-1.087 2.887-1.591 6.589-.745 8.445 2.069l-2.246 2.245c-.644-1.469-2.243-2.305-3.834-1.949-.599.134-1.168.433-1.633.898l-4.304 4.306c-1.307 1.307-1.307 3.433 0 4.74 1.307 1.307 3.433 1.307 4.74 0l1.327-1.327c1.207.479 2.501.67 3.779.575l-2.929 2.929c-2.511 2.511-6.582 2.511-9.093 0s-2.511-6.582 0-9.093l4.304-4.306zm6.836-6.836l-2.929 2.929c1.277-.096 2.572.096 3.779.574l1.326-1.326c1.307-1.307 3.433-1.307 4.74 0 1.307 1.307 1.307 3.433 0 4.74l-4.305 4.305c-1.311 1.311-3.44 1.3-4.74 0-.303-.303-.564-.68-.727-1.051l-2.246 2.245c.236.358.481.667.796.982.812.812 1.846 1.417 3.036 1.704 1.542.371 3.194.166 4.613-.617.518-.286 1.005-.648 1.444-1.087l4.304-4.305c2.512-2.511 2.512-6.582.001-9.093-2.511-2.51-6.581-2.51-9.092 0z\"/></svg></a><strong>사용자 관점에서 동작 검증</strong></h3>\n<ul>\n<li>단순한 코드 실행이 아니라, <strong>실제 사용자의 시나리오를 검증</strong>함.</li>\n<li>예: \"사용자가 회원 가입을 하면, 로그인할 수 있어야 한다.\"</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 id=\"전체-시스템을-테스트-E2E-포함\" style=\"position:relative;\"><a href=\"#%EC%A0%84%EC%B2%B4-%EC%8B%9C%EC%8A%A4%ED%85%9C%EC%9D%84-%ED%85%8C%EC%8A%A4%ED%8A%B8-E2E-%ED%8F%AC%ED%95%A8\" aria-label=\"전체 시스템을 테스트 E2E 포함 permalink\" class=\"heading-anchor before\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"15\" height=\"15\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M6.188 8.719c.439-.439.926-.801 1.444-1.087 2.887-1.591 6.589-.745 8.445 2.069l-2.246 2.245c-.644-1.469-2.243-2.305-3.834-1.949-.599.134-1.168.433-1.633.898l-4.304 4.306c-1.307 1.307-1.307 3.433 0 4.74 1.307 1.307 3.433 1.307 4.74 0l1.327-1.327c1.207.479 2.501.67 3.779.575l-2.929 2.929c-2.511 2.511-6.582 2.511-9.093 0s-2.511-6.582 0-9.093l4.304-4.306zm6.836-6.836l-2.929 2.929c1.277-.096 2.572.096 3.779.574l1.326-1.326c1.307-1.307 3.433-1.307 4.74 0 1.307 1.307 1.307 3.433 0 4.74l-4.305 4.305c-1.311 1.311-3.44 1.3-4.74 0-.303-.303-.564-.68-.727-1.051l-2.246 2.245c.236.358.481.667.796.982.812.812 1.846 1.417 3.036 1.704 1.542.371 3.194.166 4.613-.617.518-.286 1.005-.648 1.444-1.087l4.304-4.305c2.512-2.511 2.512-6.582.001-9.093-2.511-2.51-6.581-2.51-9.092 0z\"/></svg></a><strong>전체 시스템을 테스트 (E2E 포함)</strong></h3>\n<ul>\n<li>REST API, 데이터베이스, 보안 설정 등 <strong>전체 애플리케이션의 동작을 포함한 검증</strong></li>\n<li>단순한 API 응답뿐만 아니라, <strong>비즈니스 로직, DB 반영 여부까지 확인 가능</strong></li>\n</ul>\n<h3 id=\"REST-API-기반의-테스트가-일반적\" style=\"position:relative;\"><a href=\"#REST-API-%EA%B8%B0%EB%B0%98%EC%9D%98-%ED%85%8C%EC%8A%A4%ED%8A%B8%EA%B0%80-%EC%9D%BC%EB%B0%98%EC%A0%81\" aria-label=\"REST API 기반의 테스트가 일반적 permalink\" class=\"heading-anchor before\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"15\" height=\"15\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M6.188 8.719c.439-.439.926-.801 1.444-1.087 2.887-1.591 6.589-.745 8.445 2.069l-2.246 2.245c-.644-1.469-2.243-2.305-3.834-1.949-.599.134-1.168.433-1.633.898l-4.304 4.306c-1.307 1.307-1.307 3.433 0 4.74 1.307 1.307 3.433 1.307 4.74 0l1.327-1.327c1.207.479 2.501.67 3.779.575l-2.929 2.929c-2.511 2.511-6.582 2.511-9.093 0s-2.511-6.582 0-9.093l4.304-4.306zm6.836-6.836l-2.929 2.929c1.277-.096 2.572.096 3.779.574l1.326-1.326c1.307-1.307 3.433-1.307 4.74 0 1.307 1.307 1.307 3.433 0 4.74l-4.305 4.305c-1.311 1.311-3.44 1.3-4.74 0-.303-.303-.564-.68-.727-1.051l-2.246 2.245c.236.358.481.667.796.982.812.812 1.846 1.417 3.036 1.704 1.542.371 3.194.166 4.613-.617.518-.286 1.005-.648 1.444-1.087l4.304-4.305c2.512-2.511 2.512-6.582.001-9.093-2.511-2.51-6.581-2.51-9.092 0z\"/></svg></a><strong>REST API 기반의 테스트가 일반적</strong></h3>\n<ul>\n<li><code class=\"language-text\">RestAssured</code>를 사용하여 <strong>HTTP 요청-응답을 기반으로 검증</strong></li>\n<li><strong>Spring Boot에서는 <code class=\"language-text\">@SpringBootTest(webEnvironment = WebEnvironment.RANDOM_PORT)</code>를 사용</strong>하여 서버를 띄워 테스트</li>\n</ul>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"-REST-assured\" style=\"position:relative;\"><a href=\"#-REST-assured\" aria-label=\" REST assured permalink\" class=\"heading-anchor before\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"15\" height=\"15\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M6.188 8.719c.439-.439.926-.801 1.444-1.087 2.887-1.591 6.589-.745 8.445 2.069l-2.246 2.245c-.644-1.469-2.243-2.305-3.834-1.949-.599.134-1.168.433-1.633.898l-4.304 4.306c-1.307 1.307-1.307 3.433 0 4.74 1.307 1.307 3.433 1.307 4.74 0l1.327-1.327c1.207.479 2.501.67 3.779.575l-2.929 2.929c-2.511 2.511-6.582 2.511-9.093 0s-2.511-6.582 0-9.093l4.304-4.306zm6.836-6.836l-2.929 2.929c1.277-.096 2.572.096 3.779.574l1.326-1.326c1.307-1.307 3.433-1.307 4.74 0 1.307 1.307 1.307 3.433 0 4.74l-4.305 4.305c-1.311 1.311-3.44 1.3-4.74 0-.303-.303-.564-.68-.727-1.051l-2.246 2.245c.236.358.481.667.796.982.812.812 1.846 1.417 3.036 1.704 1.542.371 3.194.166 4.613-.617.518-.286 1.005-.648 1.444-1.087l4.304-4.305c2.512-2.511 2.512-6.582.001-9.093-2.511-2.51-6.581-2.51-9.092 0z\"/></svg></a>📌 <strong>REST-assured</strong></h2>\n<p>✅ <strong>REST API를 테스트하기 위한 Java 기반의 라이브러리</strong><br>\n✅ <strong>HTTP 요청을 보내고, 응답을 검증하는 기능을 제공</strong><br>\n✅ <strong>Spring Boot, JUnit과 함께 API 테스트를 수행할 때 많이 사용됨</strong>  </p>\n<p>REST Assured는 2.0 버전 이후로 <strong>BDD 스타일</strong>(<code class=\"language-text\">Given-When-Then</code>)을 기반으로 API 테스트를 작성하도록 설계되었다.  </p>\n<h3 id=\"Given설정-요청-준비\" style=\"position:relative;\"><a href=\"#Given%EC%84%A4%EC%A0%95-%EC%9A%94%EC%B2%AD-%EC%A4%80%EB%B9%84\" aria-label=\"Given설정 요청 준비 permalink\" class=\"heading-anchor before\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"15\" height=\"15\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M6.188 8.719c.439-.439.926-.801 1.444-1.087 2.887-1.591 6.589-.745 8.445 2.069l-2.246 2.245c-.644-1.469-2.243-2.305-3.834-1.949-.599.134-1.168.433-1.633.898l-4.304 4.306c-1.307 1.307-1.307 3.433 0 4.74 1.307 1.307 3.433 1.307 4.74 0l1.327-1.327c1.207.479 2.501.67 3.779.575l-2.929 2.929c-2.511 2.511-6.582 2.511-9.093 0s-2.511-6.582 0-9.093l4.304-4.306zm6.836-6.836l-2.929 2.929c1.277-.096 2.572.096 3.779.574l1.326-1.326c1.307-1.307 3.433-1.307 4.74 0 1.307 1.307 1.307 3.433 0 4.74l-4.305 4.305c-1.311 1.311-3.44 1.3-4.74 0-.303-.303-.564-.68-.727-1.051l-2.246 2.245c.236.358.481.667.796.982.812.812 1.846 1.417 3.036 1.704 1.542.371 3.194.166 4.613-.617.518-.286 1.005-.648 1.444-1.087l4.304-4.305c2.512-2.511 2.512-6.582.001-9.093-2.511-2.51-6.581-2.51-9.092 0z\"/></svg></a><strong>Given(설정-요청 준비)</strong></h3>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>기능</th>\n<th>설명</th>\n<th>예제</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td><strong><code class=\"language-text\">baseUri()</code></strong></td>\n<td>기본 URL 설정</td>\n<td><code class=\"language-text\">given().baseUri(\"http://localhost:8080\")</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong><code class=\"language-text\">basePath()</code></strong></td>\n<td>기본 경로 설정</td>\n<td><code class=\"language-text\">given().basePath(\"/users\")</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong><code class=\"language-text\">port()</code></strong></td>\n<td>포트 설정</td>\n<td><code class=\"language-text\">given().port(8080)</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong><code class=\"language-text\">header()</code></strong></td>\n<td>요청 헤더 설정</td>\n<td><code class=\"language-text\">given().header(\"Authorization\", \"Bearer token\")</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong><code class=\"language-text\">contentType()</code></strong></td>\n<td>요청 데이터 타입 설정</td>\n<td><code class=\"language-text\">given().contentType(\"application/json\")</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong><code class=\"language-text\">body()</code></strong></td>\n<td>요청 본문 (JSON, XML 등) 설정</td>\n<td><code class=\"language-text\">given().body(\"{ \\\"name\\\": \\\"Alice\\\" }\")</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong><code class=\"language-text\">pathParam()</code></strong></td>\n<td>경로 변수 설정</td>\n<td><code class=\"language-text\">given().pathParam(\"id\", 1)</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong><code class=\"language-text\">queryParam()</code></strong></td>\n<td>쿼리 파라미터 설정</td>\n<td><code class=\"language-text\">given().queryParam(\"sort\", \"name\")</code></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<ul>\n<li>API 요청을 보낼 때 필요한 정보(헤더, 파라미터, 본문 등)을 설정한다.</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>🔹 Default Values</strong><br>\nREST-assured는 기본적으로 host를 localhost, port를 8080으로 지정하지만, 메서드나 설정 파일을 통해 값을 변경할 수 있다.</p>\n<p><strong>메서드</strong></p>\n<div class=\"gatsby-highlight\" data-language=\"java\"><pre class=\"language-java\"><code class=\"language-java\"><span class=\"token function\">given</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span><span class=\"token function\">port</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token number\">80</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span></code></pre></div>\n<p><strong>설정 파일</strong></p>\n<div class=\"gatsby-highlight\" data-language=\"properties\"><pre class=\"language-properties\"><code class=\"language-properties\"><span class=\"token key attr-name\">RestAssured.baseURI</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">=</span> <span class=\"token value attr-value\">\"http://myhost.org\";</span></code></pre></div>\n<h3 id=\"When행위-요청-실행\" style=\"position:relative;\"><a href=\"#When%ED%96%89%EC%9C%84-%EC%9A%94%EC%B2%AD-%EC%8B%A4%ED%96%89\" aria-label=\"When행위 요청 실행 permalink\" class=\"heading-anchor before\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"15\" height=\"15\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M6.188 8.719c.439-.439.926-.801 1.444-1.087 2.887-1.591 6.589-.745 8.445 2.069l-2.246 2.245c-.644-1.469-2.243-2.305-3.834-1.949-.599.134-1.168.433-1.633.898l-4.304 4.306c-1.307 1.307-1.307 3.433 0 4.74 1.307 1.307 3.433 1.307 4.74 0l1.327-1.327c1.207.479 2.501.67 3.779.575l-2.929 2.929c-2.511 2.511-6.582 2.511-9.093 0s-2.511-6.582 0-9.093l4.304-4.306zm6.836-6.836l-2.929 2.929c1.277-.096 2.572.096 3.779.574l1.326-1.326c1.307-1.307 3.433-1.307 4.74 0 1.307 1.307 1.307 3.433 0 4.74l-4.305 4.305c-1.311 1.311-3.44 1.3-4.74 0-.303-.303-.564-.68-.727-1.051l-2.246 2.245c.236.358.481.667.796.982.812.812 1.846 1.417 3.036 1.704 1.542.371 3.194.166 4.613-.617.518-.286 1.005-.648 1.444-1.087l4.304-4.305c2.512-2.511 2.512-6.582.001-9.093-2.511-2.51-6.581-2.51-9.092 0z\"/></svg></a><strong>When(행위-요청 실행)</strong></h3>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>기능</th>\n<th>설명</th>\n<th>예제</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td><strong><code class=\"language-text\">get()</code></strong></td>\n<td>GET 요청 전송</td>\n<td><code class=\"language-text\">when().get(\"/users/{id}\")</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong><code class=\"language-text\">post()</code></strong></td>\n<td>POST 요청 전송</td>\n<td><code class=\"language-text\">when().post(\"/users\")</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong><code class=\"language-text\">put()</code></strong></td>\n<td>PUT 요청 전송</td>\n<td><code class=\"language-text\">when().put(\"/users/{id}\")</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong><code class=\"language-text\">delete()</code></strong></td>\n<td>DELETE 요청 전송</td>\n<td><code class=\"language-text\">when().delete(\"/users/{id}\")</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong><code class=\"language-text\">patch()</code></strong></td>\n<td>PATCH 요청 전송</td>\n<td><code class=\"language-text\">when().patch(\"/users/{id}\")</code></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<ul>\n<li>설정된 요청을 실행해 실제 HTTP 요청을 보낸다.</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 id=\"Then검증-응답-확인\" style=\"position:relative;\"><a href=\"#Then%EA%B2%80%EC%A6%9D-%EC%9D%91%EB%8B%B5-%ED%99%95%EC%9D%B8\" aria-label=\"Then검증 응답 확인 permalink\" class=\"heading-anchor before\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"15\" height=\"15\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M6.188 8.719c.439-.439.926-.801 1.444-1.087 2.887-1.591 6.589-.745 8.445 2.069l-2.246 2.245c-.644-1.469-2.243-2.305-3.834-1.949-.599.134-1.168.433-1.633.898l-4.304 4.306c-1.307 1.307-1.307 3.433 0 4.74 1.307 1.307 3.433 1.307 4.74 0l1.327-1.327c1.207.479 2.501.67 3.779.575l-2.929 2.929c-2.511 2.511-6.582 2.511-9.093 0s-2.511-6.582 0-9.093l4.304-4.306zm6.836-6.836l-2.929 2.929c1.277-.096 2.572.096 3.779.574l1.326-1.326c1.307-1.307 3.433-1.307 4.74 0 1.307 1.307 1.307 3.433 0 4.74l-4.305 4.305c-1.311 1.311-3.44 1.3-4.74 0-.303-.303-.564-.68-.727-1.051l-2.246 2.245c.236.358.481.667.796.982.812.812 1.846 1.417 3.036 1.704 1.542.371 3.194.166 4.613-.617.518-.286 1.005-.648 1.444-1.087l4.304-4.305c2.512-2.511 2.512-6.582.001-9.093-2.511-2.51-6.581-2.51-9.092 0z\"/></svg></a><strong>Then(검증-응답 확인)</strong></h3>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>기능</th>\n<th>설명</th>\n<th>예제</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td><strong><code class=\"language-text\">statusCode()</code></strong></td>\n<td>HTTP 상태 코드 검증</td>\n<td><code class=\"language-text\">then().statusCode(200)</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong><code class=\"language-text\">body()</code></strong></td>\n<td>응답 본문(JSON, XML 등) 값 검증</td>\n<td><code class=\"language-text\">then().body(\"name\", equalTo(\"Alice\"))</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong><code class=\"language-text\">header()</code></strong></td>\n<td>응답 헤더 값 검증</td>\n<td><code class=\"language-text\">then().header(\"Content-Type\", \"application/json\")</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong><code class=\"language-text\">time()</code></strong></td>\n<td>응답 시간 검증</td>\n<td><code class=\"language-text\">then().time(lessThan(2000L))</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong><code class=\"language-text\">extract()</code></strong></td>\n<td>응답 값 추출</td>\n<td><code class=\"language-text\">then().extract().jsonPath().getString(\"token\")</code></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<ul>\n<li>응답이 예상한 값과 일치하는지 검증한다.</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>🔹 ExtractableResponse</strong><br>\nextract() 메서드를 통해 응답 정보를 담은 객체를 반환받아 AssertJ로 테스트할 수 있다.</p>\n<div class=\"gatsby-highlight\" data-language=\"java\"><pre class=\"language-java\"><code class=\"language-java\"><span class=\"token keyword\">protected</span> <span class=\"token keyword\">void</span> 회원가입_검증<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token class-name\">ExtractableResponse</span> response<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span>  \n    <span class=\"token keyword\">int</span> code <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> response<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span><span class=\"token function\">statusCode</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span>  \n    <span class=\"token function\">assertThat</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>code<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span><span class=\"token function\">isEqualTo</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token class-name\">HttpStatus</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span><span class=\"token constant\">CREATED</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span><span class=\"token function\">value</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span>  \n<span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span></code></pre></div>\n<h3 id=\"vs-MockMVC\" style=\"position:relative;\"><a href=\"#vs-MockMVC\" aria-label=\"vs MockMVC permalink\" class=\"heading-anchor before\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"15\" height=\"15\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M6.188 8.719c.439-.439.926-.801 1.444-1.087 2.887-1.591 6.589-.745 8.445 2.069l-2.246 2.245c-.644-1.469-2.243-2.305-3.834-1.949-.599.134-1.168.433-1.633.898l-4.304 4.306c-1.307 1.307-1.307 3.433 0 4.74 1.307 1.307 3.433 1.307 4.74 0l1.327-1.327c1.207.479 2.501.67 3.779.575l-2.929 2.929c-2.511 2.511-6.582 2.511-9.093 0s-2.511-6.582 0-9.093l4.304-4.306zm6.836-6.836l-2.929 2.929c1.277-.096 2.572.096 3.779.574l1.326-1.326c1.307-1.307 3.433-1.307 4.74 0 1.307 1.307 1.307 3.433 0 4.74l-4.305 4.305c-1.311 1.311-3.44 1.3-4.74 0-.303-.303-.564-.68-.727-1.051l-2.246 2.245c.236.358.481.667.796.982.812.812 1.846 1.417 3.036 1.704 1.542.371 3.194.166 4.613-.617.518-.286 1.005-.648 1.444-1.087l4.304-4.305c2.512-2.511 2.512-6.582.001-9.093-2.511-2.51-6.581-2.51-9.092 0z\"/></svg></a><strong>vs MockMVC</strong></h3>\n<p>✅ REST Assured와 MockMvc는 <strong>둘 다 API 테스트를 수행할 수 있지만, 사용하는 환경이 다름</strong><br>\n✅ <strong>MockMvc는 실제 HTTP 요청을 보내지 않고, Controller 계층을 Mock으로 테스트하는 반면, RestAssured는 실제 서버에서 테스트를 수행</strong></p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>테스트 방식</th>\n<th>설명</th>\n<th>실제 네트워크 요청</th>\n<th>Spring 컨텍스트 필요 여부</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>MockMvc</strong></td>\n<td>Controller 계층만 테스트</td>\n<td>❌</td>\n<td>⭕</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>Rest Assured</strong></td>\n<td>전체 애플리케이션을 실행하고 API 테스트 수행</td>\n<td>⭕</td>\n<td>⭕</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"-참고\" style=\"position:relative;\"><a href=\"#-%EC%B0%B8%EA%B3%A0\" aria-label=\" 참고 permalink\" class=\"heading-anchor before\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"15\" height=\"15\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M6.188 8.719c.439-.439.926-.801 1.444-1.087 2.887-1.591 6.589-.745 8.445 2.069l-2.246 2.245c-.644-1.469-2.243-2.305-3.834-1.949-.599.134-1.168.433-1.633.898l-4.304 4.306c-1.307 1.307-1.307 3.433 0 4.74 1.307 1.307 3.433 1.307 4.74 0l1.327-1.327c1.207.479 2.501.67 3.779.575l-2.929 2.929c-2.511 2.511-6.582 2.511-9.093 0s-2.511-6.582 0-9.093l4.304-4.306zm6.836-6.836l-2.929 2.929c1.277-.096 2.572.096 3.779.574l1.326-1.326c1.307-1.307 3.433-1.307 4.74 0 1.307 1.307 1.307 3.433 0 4.74l-4.305 4.305c-1.311 1.311-3.44 1.3-4.74 0-.303-.303-.564-.68-.727-1.051l-2.246 2.245c.236.358.481.667.796.982.812.812 1.846 1.417 3.036 1.704 1.542.371 3.194.166 4.613-.617.518-.286 1.005-.648 1.444-1.087l4.304-4.305c2.512-2.511 2.512-6.582.001-9.093-2.511-2.51-6.581-2.51-9.092 0z\"/></svg></a><strong>📌 참고</strong></h2>\n<p><a href=\"https://tecoble.techcourse.co.kr/post/2021-05-25-unit-test-vs-integration-test-vs-acceptance-test/\">https://tecoble.techcourse.co.kr/post/2021-05-25-unit-test-vs-integration-test-vs-acceptance-test/</a><br>\n<a href=\"https://github.com/rest-assured/rest-assured/wiki/Usage\">https://github.com/rest-assured/rest-assured/wiki/Usage</a><br>\n<a href=\"https://www.baeldung.com/rest-assured-tutorial\">https://www.baeldung.com/rest-assured-tutorial</a></p>","frontmatter":{"title":"Acceptance Test","date":"March 14, 2025","update":"March 14, 2025","tags":["Test"],"series":"TDD 적용을 위한 이론 정리"},"fields":{"slug":"/Acceptance Test/","readingTime":{"minutes":4.525}}},"seriesList":{"edges":[{"node":{"id":"a128a8df-b4f8-5c72-ab99-e86fdb70e115","fields":{"slug":"/TDD 개요/"},"frontmatter":{"title":"TDD 개요"}}},{"node":{"id":"b83259a7-303f-5b73-837e-aecfe60f6d6b","fields":{"slug":"/JUnit & AssertJ/"},"frontmatter":{"title":"JUnit & AssertJ"}}},{"node":{"id":"91dfef92-91ad-5051-b9a2-1bbae3b58cd1","fields":{"slug":"/Test Double/"},"frontmatter":{"title":"Test Double"}}},{"node":{"id":"8782e9a3-9fbc-5a45-a537-105b8b7ee723","fields":{"slug":"/Mockito/"},"frontmatter":{"title":"Mockito"}}},{"node":{"id":"a946efa9-035e-5e48-868e-227bf99c287c","fields":{"slug":"/Slice Test/"},"frontmatter":{"title":"Slice Test"}}},{"node":{"id":"f7d5b0c1-7380-5c33-b2ff-f35c6411f797","fields":{"slug":"/Acceptance Test/"},"frontmatter":{"title":"Acceptance Test"}}}]},"previous":{"fields":{"slug":"/Slice Test/"},"frontmatter":{"title":"Slice Test"}},"next":{"fields":{"slug":"/HTTP/"},"frontmatter":{"title":"HTTP"}}},"pageContext":{"id":"f7d5b0c1-7380-5c33-b2ff-f35c6411f797","series":"TDD 적용을 위한 이론 정리","previousPostId":"a946efa9-035e-5e48-868e-227bf99c287c","nextPostId":"3e4a7817-1844-5fdb-9224-a72daa8b8373"}},"staticQueryHashes":[],"slicesMap":{}}